 and In stay.\n* **Text on the board:** the title is \"Booking status\". The subtitle is \"Every status a Roamstay booking passes through, and what moves it on\".\n* **Critique question:** does the eye land on Confirmed first, since it is the largest shape, and is that where the team needs to look?\n\nIs this the right reading of the board?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2671,"cache_read_input_tokens":102097,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2671},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c020ab68-b4de-4c10-b6ca-23357620d1a4","uuid":"98569a02-55e5-4ab7-816c-79f53d6f9b43","timestamp":"2026-10-27T05:33:45.744Z","request_id":"req_011CgSCMJA9qpVNkDLySbLVQ"}
